SUMMARY:English Conversation Circle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261106T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261106T113000
UID:69f4a06ec1cf6f9a75890d75@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you learning English or new to Canada? Practice your Engli
 sh conversation skills in a relaxing environment while making new friends.
  All levels are welcome. Please note that this is not a formal English cla
 ss.\nDrop-in or register
LOCATION:Cedarbrae - Closed\, Youth hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f4a06ec1cf6f9a75890d75
