 preneur in Residence (Newcomer Focus)\, Jean Chow\, to expand your perso
 nal network through the TPL Small Business community and share your sugge
 stions on ways to make TPL’s Small Business Programs and Services serve 
 you better!\nIn this session:\nCreate a strong small business community wi
 th members who are motivated to help and support one another on a regular 
 basis.\nHelp the library serve you better while reaching more of the busin
 ess community\; provide suggestions on what small businesses really want f
 rom the library.\nExplore the use of the “Entrepreneurs Suite” at the 
 North York Central Library.\nCome early to network from 6-6:30pm!\nTo appl
 y for one-on-one consultations with our resident entrepreneur\, Jean\, ple
 ase fill out the in-take form available at\ntpl.ca/eir\n.\nInformation Col
 lection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the
