DESCRIPTION:Join us for a lively and fun discussion about the selected boo
 k of the month.\nThis book club has relocated to Main Street Branch during
  Dawes Road Branch's closure. New club members are welcome. Each month's s
 election will be available for checkout after the previous month's meetin
 g.\nAugust 10 :\nThe Museum of Extraordinary Things\nby Alice Hoffman\nSep
 tember 14 :\nDo Not Say We Have Nothing\nby Madeleine Thien\nOctober 5 :\n
 Such A Fun Age\nby Kiley Reid\nNovember 9 :\nFifth Business\nby Robertson 
 Davies\nDecember 7 :\nAnxious People\nby Fredrik Backman\nFor adults.\nReg
 istration is required. Please register in-person or by calling 416-393-770
 0.
LOCATION:Main Street\, Basement Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a567224daaaf4f51a1fba71
