DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261118T190000
UID:6ab16b5086d845003117b6b6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join\nThe Atlas Connective\nfor an evening of curated network
 ing\, guided peer conversations\, and community-building\nfor women entrep
 reneurs who are just starting out\, exploring their ideas\, or looking to
  grow with greater clarity and confidence.\nRegistration is required\n.\nS
 pots are limited.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informatio
 n on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public
  Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will 
 only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation.
  Questions about how the library handles your information can be directed 
