 rovide an overview of CRA's digital services\, including My Account\, a se
 cure portal that allows you to track your refund\, view benefit and credit
  payments\, update personal information\, set up direct deposit\, receive 
 online mail\, and access a variety of CRA services. They will also discuss
 \nBenefit and credit payments\nProtecting yourself from scams\nFree tax he
 lp\nWhy filing taxes matters\nWays to file your taxes\nAccessibility\nLive
  or automated closed captioning\, sign language interpretation\, interveno
 r services\, or attendant services are available upon request. Please subm
 it your request at least 2 weeks in advance to: tpl.ca/accessibility-event
 s.
