DESCRIPTION:Join us at the library to create fun spooky (or spoopy) staine
 d glass pieces! Let your imagination run wild or use one of the patterns p
 rovided in the program.\nAll supplies will be provided\, just show up and 
 no experience required. This craft will be done using cold glass paint\, s
